  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, justifyContent: 'center', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>这本书哪一处说不通？</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 36, borderLeft: '4px solid #B4552D', paddingLeft: 24 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>五周里你们问的问题，一半是“我不懂”，一半是“他不对”。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#B4552D', lineHeight: 1.9, marginTop: 6 }}>今天只处理后一半。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
